{"version":1,"content":"<p>金馬影后陳秋霞曾拍攝過作品《煙波江上》及《第二道彩虹》，作品《一個女工的故事》為她奪得巴拿馬電影節最佳女主角，1976年首次主演由其個人故事改編的電影《秋霞》，即憑該片奪得第14屆台灣金馬獎最佳女主角，創下當時最年輕影后紀錄之一，成績斐然。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:23:54.798590+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T04:01:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T04:17:15.372014+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T04:17:15.372014+00:00","content_hash":"690b15601ce74b28bcf192f553123e818ae156ccc1c84fd2b84617c8f5be711b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}